Description:
    Creates tasks for execution on deployment

Example:
    rails generate deploy_pin:task some_name_of_task -a author -g I

    This will create:
        lib/deploy_pin/{task_id}_some_name_of_task.rb
        spec/deploy_pin/{task_id}_some_name_of_task_spec.rb

    The test framework comes from DeployPin.test_framework (default: rspec),
    and the directory from DeployPin.tests_path (default: spec/deploy_pin).
    Use --skip-test to not create the test, or --test-framework=rspec to pick one.
